OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIt will stay
OL,6,Fdry with evening sunshine followed by
OL,7,Flengthy clear periods overnight.
OL,8,FHowever, the odd patch of low cloud or
OL,9,Fmist could reform by the morning. A
OL,10,Fwarm and humid night with light winds.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FA fine and bright start,
OL,13,Fleaving another dry and settled day
OL,14,Facross the region with a good deal of
OL,15,Fsunshine. Turning very hot in the
OL,16,Fafternoon, with light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
